{{~##
   The closing markup every generated page shares.

   The wrapping <div class="container-fluid"> is gone with Bootstrap - the padding it
   provided is on the body now - so there is no </div> here to close it.

   The footer used to end with `by {{ user }}`, taken from the machine's account name.
   Generated pages get committed, so that put whoever ran the conversion into somebody's
   repository - and made the file churn for every contributor who regenerated it. The
   timestamp answers what the line was for.
##~}}
<h4>This file was created at {{ created_at }}</h4></body></html>
